</td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Allows improved stealthed movement. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Rogue</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">18 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Fancy Footwork </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Greatly increases parry skill. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Rogue </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">19 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Smuggler&#39;s Talent </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Allows the rogue to move in stealth with little to no movement penalty. 60 sec recast 3 sec cast. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Rogue</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">19 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Distracting Blade </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">A flank attack that deals medium damage and interrupts an enemy. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Swashbuckler</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">20 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Swashbuckler&#39;s Charm </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">On more than one occasion, a swashbuckler&#39;s charm has gotten them out of trouble. Sometimes though it does the opposite. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Swashbuckler </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">20 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Flamboyant Swathe </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">An area of effect melee attack. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Swashbuckler</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">21 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Swarthy Distraction </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Places a reactive hate proc on the target. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Swashbuckler</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">21 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Shanghai </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">A high damage stealth attack that knocks an opponent down. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Swashbuckler </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">22 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Undercut </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Deals damage and snares a target on successful hit. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Swashbuckler</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">22 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Flashy Trick </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Decreases enemy defense and slightly increases hate towards the swashbuckler. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Swashbuckler</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">23 </td