ow2.jpg">26 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Snap of the wrist </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Two precise high damage attacks. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Swashbuckler</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">26 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Disarming Grin </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Mesmerizes a single target for a short time. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Swashbuckler </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">27 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Flight of Fancy </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Increases agility, strength and reduces hate generation. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Swashbuckler</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">27 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Risky advance </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Increases melee attack techniques and reduces defense technique. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Brigand</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">27 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Risky advance </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Increases melee attack techniques and reduces defense technique. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Swashbuckler </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">28 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Flurry of Arms </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">An extra series of 3 attacks. If an attack misses the series ends. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Swashbuckler</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">28 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Deft Rush </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">A precise high damage multi-enemy attack. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Swashbuckler</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">29 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Playful Swipe </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">A quick attack that knocks down the enemy and decreases hate towards the swashbuckler. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Swashbuckler </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">29 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Nimble Cut </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">A precise attack that has a chance to stun the enemy. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Swashbuckler</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">30 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Watery Shot </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Requires a ranged weapon. Launches two shots at once that drain enemy power and deal cold damage. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Swashbuckler</f