 interrupts the target. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Swashbuckler</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">33 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Lie Low </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Lie low allows you to hide and reduce your hate dramatically. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Brigand</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">33 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Lie Low </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Lie low allows you to hide and reduce your hate dramatically. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Swashbuckler </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">34 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Rakish Swathe </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">An area of effect melee attack. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Swashbuckler</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">35 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Ambuscade </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">A high damage stealth attack that knocks the opponent down and reduces agility. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Swashbuckler</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">36 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Tricky Display </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Decreases enemy defense, sligh